Build complete Expo React Native mobile app in mobile/

This implements a full WhatsApp-like mobile app that mirrors the web app's features, connecting to all existing Flask backend APIs.

Files created:
- mobile/package.json — Expo SDK 51 + expo-router, socket.io, zustand, axios, expo-camera, expo-av, expo-image-picker
- mobile/app.json — iOS/Android/web config with all permissions declared
- mobile/babel.config.js — includes react-native-reanimated/plugin
- mobile/config.js — API_URL/SOCKET_URL from EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL env var; color tokens
- mobile/.env — API URL configuration template

Services:
- mobile/services/api.js — Axios with JWT Bearer token + refresh-token retry interceptor
- mobile/services/store.js — Zustand stores for auth, chat, status, calls
- mobile/services/socket.js — Socket.IO client with auto-reconnect
- mobile/services/storage.js — AsyncStorage wrappers for token persistence

Data:
- mobile/data/countries.js — 190+ country dial codes with flag emoji helper

Components (8):
- Avatar, EmptyState, TypingIndicator, ChatListItem, PhoneInput (modal country picker),
  MessageBubble (text/image/voice/location/contact/reactions), EmojiPicker, VoiceRecorder

Screens (12):
- _layout.js — GestureHandlerRootView + SafeAreaProvider + JWT auth check on boot
- index.js — redirect based on auth state
- login.js — PhoneInput + password with JWT login
- signup.js — 3-step: phone → SMS verify → name/password
- (tabs)/_layout.js — 3 tabs (Chats/Status/Calls) with Socket.IO init + settings header button
- (tabs)/index.js — chat list with real-time updates, add contact modal, QR button
- (tabs)/status.js — view/post WhatsApp-style status updates with background color picker
- (tabs)/calls.js — call history with direction/type indicators
- chat/[id].js — full chat: inverted FlatList, emoji picker, voice recorder, image upload, typing indicator
- profile.js — avatar upload, bio, email, country/city editor
- settings.js — privacy, notifications, storage toggles via PUT /api/settings
